161	 *
162	 * **Accepted inputs:**
163	 * - `undefined` / `null` → returns `undefined`
164	 * - `GitCredentialEntry[]` (new format) → validated and returned as-is
165	 * - `Record<string, string>` (old format, hostname→token map) → migrated to
166	 *   `GitCredentialEntry[]` with `id` derived from the hostname in kebab-case
167	 *   and `label` set to the hostname. Colliding IDs get a numeric suffix (`-2`,
168	 *   `-3`, …).
169	 * - An empty array `[]` → returns `[]`
170	 *
171	 * **Validation (new-format arrays):**
